907
00:32:03,950 --> 00:32:04,640
What does that mean?

908
00:32:06,150 --> 00:32:07,200
This fermented fish

909
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:08,920
is my grandfather's recipe.

910
00:32:09,060 --> 00:32:10,990
I thought it didn't sell well,

911
00:32:11,140 --> 00:32:12,450
and there was only one pot left.

912
00:32:12,640 --> 00:32:14,020
I thought that I could sell it,

913
00:32:14,540 --> 00:32:16,370
but you guys spilled it before I could.

914
00:32:16,370 --> 00:32:17,240
Oh...

915
00:32:18,020 --> 00:32:19,170
Whoa, you're blaming us?

916
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:21,650
You were being suspicious,

917
00:32:21,650 --> 00:32:23,080
so we thought you were a thief.

918
00:32:23,300 --> 00:32:23,940
Darn it...

919
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:26,040
Do you practice black magic as well?

920
00:32:26,250 --> 00:32:27,790
When you picked up
the prayer beads,

921
00:32:28,000 --> 00:32:29,280
I saw you mumbling

922
00:32:29,280 --> 00:32:30,700
as if you were chanting
some incantation.

923
00:32:30,700 --> 00:32:31,350
Yeah.

924
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:33,160
That wasn't an incantation.

925
00:32:33,460 --> 00:32:34,780
This was my mom's necklace.

926
00:32:36,190 --> 00:32:36,760
Mom,

927
00:32:36,760 --> 00:32:37,940
I'll have to borrow this necklace,

928
00:32:38,340 --> 00:32:39,400
and hit these people with it.

929
00:32:39,920 --> 00:32:40,990
Please don't get mad at me.

930
00:32:41,820 --> 00:32:42,190
Oh...

931
00:32:42,190 --> 00:32:43,390
Whoa, whoa, whoa.

932
00:32:43,390 --> 00:32:44,260
Ugh!

933
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:45,160
Mr. Don,

934
00:32:45,310 --> 00:32:47,580
I'll have to warn you that

935
00:32:47,800 --> 00:32:50,010
if you keep making and selling
fermented fish in this dorm,

936
00:32:50,010 --> 00:32:51,660
I won't let you stay here.

937
00:32:51,660 --> 00:32:52,770
It's against the rules.

938
00:32:53,180 --> 00:32:53,720
Uh...

939
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:55,240
Then can I ditch the fish and sell

940
00:32:55,240 --> 00:32:56,840
fried insects instead?

941
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:58,610
Lately, I've been into...

942
00:32:58,610 --> 00:32:59,560
Duang with You Series.'

943
00:32:59,560 --> 00:33:00,820
- Ugh...
- Ugh.

944
00:33:00,820 --> 00:33:02,010
You only watch shows from one company, huh?

945
00:33:02,290 --> 00:33:03,370
Have you learned nothing?

946
00:33:03,540 --> 00:33:04,180
Ow...

947
00:33:04,860 --> 00:33:05,900
If your insects

948
00:33:05,900 --> 00:33:08,590
got out of the enclosure,
what would you do?

949
00:33:08,610 --> 00:33:09,900
You talk a lot for someone
who can't talk properly.

950
00:33:11,100 --> 00:33:12,700
You're injured but you keep
running your mouth.

951
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:16,130
Hey, Dobby.

952
00:33:16,690 --> 00:33:17,260
Huh?

953
00:33:20,120 --> 00:33:22,100
If this isn't the shaman
Mr. Suraphon has sent,

954
00:33:22,620 --> 00:33:23,400
then who is he?

955
00:33:24,560 --> 00:33:25,660
I don't know either.

956
00:33:26,290 --> 00:33:27,420
I'm stressed out.

957
00:33:28,100 --> 00:33:29,300
Where did my grandpa go?

958
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,880
Mom and Dad...

959
00:33:48,360 --> 00:33:50,590
Did you ever feel guilty

960
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:54,410
when both of you

961
00:33:56,590 --> 00:33:58,740
forced me into
an arranged marriage?

962
00:34:01,770 --> 00:34:02,880
Auntie,

963
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,850
- I apologize on my son's behalf...
- Shut up!

964
00:34:04,850 --> 00:34:05,480
You...

965
00:34:08,199 --> 00:34:09,440
Shut your stupid mouth.

966
00:34:09,790 --> 00:34:10,690
Keep your nose out of this.

967
00:34:15,790 --> 00:34:18,190
I was a deadbeat.

968
00:34:20,179 --> 00:34:22,080
A terrible father...

969
00:34:23,340 --> 00:34:25,800
I almost forced my daughter...

970
00:34:26,260 --> 00:34:28,409
to marry Surachet!

971
00:34:31,350 --> 00:34:33,100
If she had not run away,

972
00:34:36,210 --> 00:34:37,850
she would have had to marry him...

973
00:34:39,020 --> 00:34:40,100
She might have been

974
00:34:41,440 --> 00:34:43,940
living in hell right now...

975
00:34:56,739 --> 00:34:58,910
Danai Saeja!

976
00:34:59,260 --> 00:35:02,220
May you appear before me this instant.

977
00:35:02,220 --> 00:35:03,100
Who?!

978
00:35:03,580 --> 00:35:04,810
Who is calling me?!

979
00:35:07,390 --> 00:35:08,060
Who is it?!

980
00:35:08,060 --> 00:35:09,790
Danai Saeja,

981
00:35:10,140 --> 00:35:11,720
may you appear

982
00:35:11,750 --> 00:35:13,090
- before me...
- What is happening to me?!

983
00:35:13,220 --> 00:35:14,810
this instant!

984
00:35:14,810 --> 00:35:15,790
What the hell is happening?

985
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:18,210
Who is calling me?!

986
00:35:18,820 --> 00:35:19,540
Dobby.

987
00:35:19,540 --> 00:35:20,720
Danai Saeja!

988
00:35:20,720 --> 00:35:22,060
Dobby...

989
00:35:22,420 --> 00:35:24,720
- Dobby, help me.
- May you appear

990
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:26,260
before me...

991
00:35:26,590 --> 00:35:28,720
this instant!

992
00:35:30,720 --> 00:35:31,730
What should we do now?

993
00:35:31,930 --> 00:35:32,740
I don't know.

994
00:35:33,330 --> 00:35:35,320
Dobby!

995
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:37,390
Help me!

996
00:35:37,780 --> 00:35:40,460
Dobby!

997
00:35:40,460 --> 00:35:40,990
Hey,

998
00:35:41,240 --> 00:35:42,700
Grandpa is calling for help.

999
00:35:42,900 --> 00:35:43,680
Hey.

1000
00:35:44,340 --> 00:35:44,810
Whoa...

1001
00:35:46,990 --> 00:35:47,890
Have you finally arrived?

1002
00:35:47,890 --> 00:35:49,260
I feel very dizzy,

1003
00:35:49,260 --> 00:35:51,790
as if I went on a roller coaster.

1004
00:35:51,790 --> 00:35:52,820
It is time for you to

1005
00:35:52,820 --> 00:35:55,390
