1006
00:35:55,390 --> 00:35:56,060
Whoa!

1007
00:35:58,360 --> 00:35:59,580
I don't get it, Mom.

1008
00:36:00,040 --> 00:36:01,390
Each time we fight,

1009
00:36:01,390 --> 00:36:03,680
